  {
    "name": "3 · Caesar-Verschlüsselung",
    "intro": "<p>Implementiere <code>encrypt(text, shift)</code>: Jeder Kleinbuchstabe wird um <code>shift</code> Stellen im Alphabet verschoben (z → a). Andere Zeichen bleiben gleich.</p>",
    "starter": "def encrypt(text, shift):\n    # Dein Code hier\n    pass\n",
    "reference": "def encrypt(text, shift):\n    out = \"\"\n    for ch in text:\n        if 'a' <= ch <= 'z':\n            out += chr((ord(ch) - 97 + shift) % 26 + 97)\n        else:\n            out += ch\n    return out\n",
    "maxattempts": 5,
    "tests": [
      {"id": "abc", "name": "encrypt('abc', 1)", "type": "function", "function": "encrypt", "points": 2,
       "visibility": "visible", "inputs": [{"kind": "fixed", "value": "'abc'"}, {"kind": "fixed", "value": "1"}],
       "expected": {"source": "fixed", "value": "'bcd'"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}},
      {"id": "wrap", "name": "Über z hinaus", "type": "function", "function": "encrypt", "points": 2,
       "visibility": "visible", "inputs": [{"kind": "fixed", "value": "'xyz'"}, {"kind": "fixed", "value": "3"}],
       "expected": {"source": "reference"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}},
      {"id": "random", "name": "Zufällige Texte", "type": "function", "function": "encrypt", "points": 4,
       "visibility": "visible", "repeat": 5,
       "inputs": [{"kind": "str", "charset": "text", "min_len": 3, "max_len": 20}, {"kind": "int", "min": 0, "max": 25}],
       "expected": {"source": "reference"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}},
      {"id": "hidden", "name": "Versteckte Tests", "type": "function", "function": "encrypt", "points": 2,
       "visibility": "hidden", "repeat": 5,
       "inputs": [{"kind": "str", "charset": "letters", "min_len": 1, "max_len": 15}, {"kind": "int", "min": 26, "max": 60}],
       "expected": {"source": "reference"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}}
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "4 · Bankkonto (Klasse)",
    "intro": "<p>Schreibe eine Klasse <code>Konto</code> mit Attribut <code>stand</code>, Methode <code>einzahlen(betrag)</code> und <code>abheben(betrag)</code>. Abheben über den Kontostand hinaus ist nicht erlaubt (dann gibt <code>abheben</code> False zurück und ändert nichts).</p>",
    "starter": "class Konto:\n    def __init__(self, stand):\n        self.stand = stand\n",
    "reference": "class Konto:\n    def __init__(self, stand):\n        self.stand = stand\n\n    def einzahlen(self, betrag):\n        self.stand += betrag\n        return self.stand\n\n    def abheben(self, betrag):\n        if betrag > self.stand:\n            return False\n        self.stand -= betrag\n        return True\n",
    "tests": [
      {"id": "einzahlen", "name": "Einzahlen", "type": "class", "class": "Konto", "points": 4, "visibility": "visible",
       "repeat": 3, "inputs": [{"kind": "int", "min": 0, "max": 500}],
       "calls": [{"method": "einzahlen", "args": [{"kind": "int", "min": 1, "max": 200}]}],
       "target": {"type": "attr", "name": "stand"}, "expected": {"source": "reference"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}},
      {"id": "abheben", "name": "Abheben mit Deckung", "type": "class", "class": "Konto", "points": 3, "visibility": "visible",
       "inputs": [{"kind": "fixed", "value": "100"}],
       "calls": [{"method": "abheben", "args": [{"kind": "fixed", "value": "30"}]},
                 {"method": "abheben", "args": [{"kind": "fixed", "value": "500"}]}],
       "target": {"type": "returns"}, "expected": {"source": "reference"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}},
      {"id": "stand", "name": "Kontostand nach Überziehungsversuch", "type": "class", "class": "Konto", "points": 3,
       "visibility": "nameonly", "inputs": [{"kind": "int", "min": 10, "max": 50}], "repeat": 3,
       "calls": [{"method": "abheben", "args": [{"kind": "int", "min": 60, "max": 100}]}],
       "target": {"type": "attr", "name": "stand"}, "expected": {"source": "reference"}, "compare": {"mode": "exact"}}
    ]
  },
